# Director Role (Division Lead)

## Responsibilities
• Manage 4 teams (16-20 people total)
• Oversee $500k - $1M+ in annual client revenue
• Strategic vision for SEO practice
• C-level client relationships
• Budget ownership and P&L responsibility
• Cross-departmental collaboration (sales, product, tech)
• Thought leadership and industry presence
• Organizational process and systems design
• Talent acquisition strategy
• Innovation and R&D initiatives

## Required Skills
• All Manager-level competencies
• Strategic business planning
• Financial management (budgets, forecasting, margins)
• Executive presence and communication
• Industry expertise and network
• Change management
• Organizational design
• Contract negotiation at scale
• Long-term strategic thinking (1-3 year planning)

## Leadership Scope
• Multi-team coordination
• Manager development and coaching
• Cultural leadership
• Crisis management
• Strategic partnerships
• Board/investor communication
• Company-wide initiatives
• Succession planning

## Strategic Initiatives
• Practice area expansion (new services, verticals)
• Technology investment and integration
• Competitive positioning
• Market trend analysis and adaptation
• Client retention and expansion programs
• Operational excellence and efficiency
• Team scalability and growth planning
• Risk management and compliance
• Innovation lab and experimentation

## Industry Engagement
• Conference speaking and thought leadership
• Industry publication contributions
• Tool vendor relationships and beta programs
• Professional network development
• Competitive intelligence gathering
• Algorithm update analysis and response planning
